templateVersions.content:
You will receive a stringified JSON object with two fields: type and value. The type field indicates the kind of data (e.g., "Text"). The value field contains the actual content we are interested in. Task: Extract and return only the value field as plain text. Ignore the type field and any other metadata. Here is the input JSON:
{!$Input:Text}
Return only the plain text contained in the value.
